Privacy Policy for Flirt AI

Effective: November 26, 2026
Operated by: Yogee Studios
Contact: yogeestudios@gmail.com

Flirt AI is a dating and communication coaching app for adults 18 and older. This policy explains what information the app uses, where it goes, and the choices you have.

1. Information you choose to share

Account. If you sign in with Apple, we receive an account identifier and, if you choose to share it, your email address. We use these only to provide account access.

Content you submit. When you ask for AI help, the messages you type, the screenshots you select, and any optional coaching preferences you have enabled are sent for processing as described in section 2.

Stored on your device. Coaching conversations, drafts, saved history, practice sessions, lesson progress, points and streaks, and optional coaching preferences (which may include age, gender, dating preferences and goals) are saved locally on your device. Please avoid entering names, contact details or private information you do not have permission to share.

2. AI assistance

Flirt AI uses OpenAI (OpenAI, L.L.C.), a third-party AI service, to generate replies, analyses, coaching and practice feedback.

What is sent: the messages you type or paste into a feature, the screenshots you choose to analyze, and your optional coaching profile (age, gender, what you're looking for and your goals) if you have filled it in. Your contacts, location, Apple ID and photos you did not select are never sent.

How it is collected: only when you tap a button such as Generate, Analyze or Send. Selected screenshots are resized on your device first. Your data travels over an encrypted connection to our backend (hosted on Supabase), which forwards it to OpenAI.

Your permission comes first: before anything is sent, the app shows a screen explaining what is sent and that it goes to OpenAI, and asks you to tap Allow. If you choose Don't Allow, nothing is sent and the AI features stay off. You can change your choice at any time in Profile > AI privacy.

How it is used: only to produce the response you asked for. OpenAI does not use data sent through its API to train its models. OpenAI is bound by its API data commitments and processes this data under protections the same as or equal to those described in this policy.

We do not store your conversation inputs in our application database. Generated responses are cached briefly on our server (about 15 minutes) so a failed request can be retried, then removed by scheduled cleanup. Our requests to OpenAI disable response storage, but OpenAI may retain data for security and abuse monitoring under its own policies: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/your-data

Screenshot drafts are saved locally with device file protection. If you save an analysis to history, its screenshots stay with that saved result on your device until you delete it.

AI responses can be wrong. The AI cannot know another person's thoughts and is not a substitute for your own judgment or for professional advice.

3. Purchases

Apple processes all payments. RevenueCat processes a pseudonymous account identifier and your purchase and entitlement information so we can confirm your subscription. We never receive your full payment card details. We keep daily AI usage counts and request identifiers for up to 30 days to enforce usage limits and prevent fraud.

4. Your choices and deletion

You can turn off AI sharing at any time in Profile > AI privacy. You can delete local conversations and history and reset your profile in the app.

Profile > Account > Delete account removes your account, server usage records, your RevenueCat customer record, and that account's local data on the device where you request deletion. Copies on other devices must be removed on those devices. Provider logs, backups and legally required records follow their own retention periods.

Deleting your account does not cancel an Apple subscription. Manage or cancel it in your App Store account settings.

5. Security, service providers and location

We use encrypted network connections, iOS protected local files and Keychain storage for your session. Supabase, OpenAI, RevenueCat and Apple process information to deliver their services, possibly in countries other than your own. No system can guarantee absolute security.

We do not sell personal information, and we do not use it for cross-app advertising or tracking.

6. Adults only

Flirt AI is intended for adults 18 and older. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 18.

7. Your rights

Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict the use of your information. Contact yogeestudios@gmail.com to make a request or raise a concern.

8. Changes

We may update this policy. When we do, we will change the effective date above.
